Package: locarc
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Maintainer: Asahi <Asahi-Prv@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Asahi-Prv/locarc
Description: OpenVINO Model Server manager
 Manage OVMS runtimes, download models from Hugging Face, load them and chat.
 Bundles its own Python runtime; user data (models, chats, settings) is kept
 in ~/.local/share/locarc/data and survives upgrades and removal.
